      "cooked": "<p>Just an FYI, with the large amount of content I'll be posting with OblivAeon, I'll need to find ways to save storage space on my website.&nbsp; Since Tactics is no longer a going concern, that's a logical place to reclaim space so when I post up the new OblivAeon accessories (whenever that will be, I've lost track of when it's supposed to be coming at this point), I'll be taking down the Tactics section of my site.&nbsp; So if there's anything on the Tactics site you want, be sure to grab it before OblivAeon comes out.</p><p>www.spiffworld.com/tactics</p>",
