    {
      "id": 215719,
      "name": "Jeysie",
      "username": "Jeysie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-03-29T08:56:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Spiff\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/48/1865_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Spiff:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Jeysie wrote:</b><br><blockquote>You must be stuck with the world's crappiest webhost if 75MB makes much of a difference.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nAlways elegant. &nbsp;Thanks for chiming in!\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>My point was to send some sympathy your way and that if you'd like either help finding a better but still affordable webhost or a donation of webspace so you don't have to lose your files, it can be offered, but if you'd rather be that way about it then OK I guess.</p>\n<p>Edit: Basically: Dropbox offers 2GB of space for free and AFAIK does not care about files stored on it being remotely linked to on websites. I can also offer some of my own webspace.</p>\n<p>But I didn't know if the problem really was \"yeah my webhost is really tiny in its limits and it sucks\" or \"I just don't feel like I want to worry about maintaining a Tactics section anymore so I'm using the storage thing as a reason to free up headspace\", hence my response in the hopes of a reply that would illuminate the issue more before I made an offer. But again, if that's the reply I got instead, then OK I guess. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=12\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:47:13.944Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 1,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.2,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 17910,
      "topic_slug": "oblivaeon-to-destroy-spiffs-tactics-site",
      "display_username": "Jeysie",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
